  "graph": {
    "comments": [
      {
        "color": "#60a5fa",
        "id": "note_inputs",
        "position": {
          "x": 22,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 542
        },
        "text": "Sprite UV and the sprite itself."
      },
      {
        "color": "#4ade80",
        "id": "note_main",
        "position": {
          "x": 768,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 848
        },
        "text": "The sprite is sampled normally (*Outside: transparent*). The silhouette is `lerp(sprite colour, silhouette colour, amount)`: alpha is untouched, so the outline of the shape is exactly the sprite's."
      },
      {
        "color": "#22d3ee",
        "id": "note_shadow",
        "position": {
          "x": 768,
          "y": 600
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2072
        },
        "text": "`p = uv − offset`, then the V axis is stretched around the ground line: `p.y' = g + (p.y − g) / flatten`. Reading the sprite at a stretched coordinate draws it squashed by *Flatten* — a shadow lying on the floor."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fb923c",
        "id": "note_blur",
        "position": {
          "x": 3044,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2990
        },
        "text": "The shadow alpha is the average of the sprite alpha at the centre and four taps `±blur` along x and y. Cheap, and plenty soft for a small radius; raise *Blur* only up to a few texels."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fbbf24",
        "id": "note_compose",
        "position": {
          "x": 6238,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 848
        },
        "text": "Standard over-operator: `alpha = a + shadow × (1 − a)`; colour = `lerp(shadow colour, sprite colour, a)`."
      },
      {
        "color": "#a78bfa",
        "id": "note_out",
        "position": {
          "x": 7290,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 300
        },
        "text": "Composited colour and alpha."
      }
    ],
